{
  "name": "skuastk-cert-system",
  "private": true,
  "version": "0.0.0",
  "description": "SKUAST-Kashmir Official Digital Certification System — a comprehensive digital certificate management platform for Sher-e-Kashmir University of Agricultural Sciences and Technology of Kashmir (SKUAST-K). Issue, download, and verify academic certificates for seminars, workshops, conferences, and training programs with QR code authentication, tamper-proof verification, and end-to-end encryption. Built for DSW under NSS Units.",
